    "text": "with D412): Delta's redesigned shape (sheets at 3d2d89ea) is accepted. Tuning: every seed reads as a fan (seeds 8, 15, 19, 28 and 29 read as an ordinary river valley), and the thin water across the fan on seeds 4 and 23 is fixed. Kyler, 2026-10-02."
