    "topic": "The generator",
    "text": "amends D423): Islands takes the safe sheet's layouts (de36b1ba) and grows one island in each large enough for the start: off-centre, in a different place each seed, never a central island in a moat inside a ring of land; where a layout truly can't hold one, the start falls back to the shore. The new sheet is judged beside the safe and big-island sheets. Pending #155–#157 are accepted (sea maps draw no Hanging…"
