    "text": "with D254, D261, D264, D288, D315, D323, D345): Select is easy to find and use, and its selection is the working area. Modes: Rectangle, Circle (drag from the centre, radius shown), Freehand, Brush and Wand (a click on land selects the ground joined to it at that level; a click on water selects that river's or lake's visible water tiles connected to it, badwater counts, never thin films the view doesn't show; a…"
