    "text": "with D387, D394): Crop map to selection: with a rectangle selected (from 4×4, not necessarily square, up to the map's size) the map becomes exactly that rectangle, one undo step, recorded as an operation so share links rebuild it byte for byte; the full map stays in Your maps and undo brings it back; everything inside, edits included, comes along exactly (not a replay onto new land, D336); at the new edge rivers…"
