    "topic": "The editor and its tools",
    "text": "with D27, D222, D394; blocks the next release until it lands, D385): The canonical settle counts a sealed basin that is only evaporating as settled, as water.settles does (D222): a Fill is stored at exactly the level chosen and the game evaporates it from there, and oxbow lakes stop draining before saving; maps with oxbow lakes are re-pinned. Built as the follow-up to #167. Kyler, 2026-10-02."
