    "topic": "The editor and its tools",
    "text": "with D233, D234, D336, D343, D237): \"The page is the editor\" (UI brief docs/UI-BRIEF.md, word for word; built by the page session with the design pass, D384, enforcing D342). One workspace: the map fills the window from the first visit, with no separate editor, expand button, full screen or \"Refine this map\" step (3D is the default view everywhere, D232: the 2D toggle is gone, Top-down and the minimap remain, with…"
