    "topic": "The forces",
    "text": "with D312, D344, D361, D368): Clean, magic gestures: no force draws a predicted route, path, outline, footprint or wireframe on the land before or during its gesture (what a force decides, its reach and extent, is never drawn in advance); every click mode (Carve's Unleash, Craterize's Strike, Erupt's Vent, Unleash on a source) is one click and the force finds its own way; Aim is a drag in a direction with only a…"
