    "text": "with D321, D341, D266, D374): Pace and animation. Every force plays at its own designed pace, whatever the water's speed (D266): in Fast about 2 s (Glaciate 3.5 s with easing: slow as the ice grips, steady through, settling gently; the ice spreads and carves together, the valley deepening as the glacier advances, so the land change takes most of the time; every force is checked for an opening effect that squeezes…"
