    "text": "with D155, D156, D157, D162, D163, D174, D191): Real places: a gallery of the landscape survey's playable real-terrain maps (investigation/landscapes/library/; up to about 150 in all, additions chosen as the original 88 were: maps that pass, distinct, spread across landform families, the three random-land controls out). Each card shows our own render, its plain name (\"Grand Canyon\", no \"Near\" or \"(… sample)\"…"
