    "text": "with D46, D380, D130): Budgets: the canonical settle takes ≤ 3 s at 256² and ≤ 0.6 s at 128² (§10); CI's timing checks are reported numbers and never fail a build (D145), but a speed regression blocks a merge (D380). The 3D budget (PLAN §14.2) is measured by npm run bench:3d in the installed Chrome, headed, on 256² maps, judged on the integrated GPU (--use-adapter-luid, CPU slowed 4×); CI renders in software so it…"
